      "summary_en": "Vladimir steals life from the target enemy. When Vladimir's resource is full, Transfusion will benefit from massively increased damage and healing for a brief time.",
      "summary_zh": "弗拉基米尔从目标敌人身上偷取生命值。当弗拉基米尔的资源槽攒满后，鲜血转换将暂时获得增益，提升伤害和治疗效果。",
